@RiskEngineApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169
@PortfolioId = 1

### Service info
GET {{RiskEngineApi_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness - risk-engine-api process only
GET {{RiskEngineApi_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness - verifies portfolio-java too
GET {{RiskEngineApi_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Calculate risk
POST {{RiskEngineApi_HostAddress}}/risk/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "portfolioId": {{PortfolioId}},
  "marketVolatility": 0.35,
  "concentrationRatio": 0.40,
  "leverageRatio": 0.10
}

### Get latest calculation
GET {{RiskEngineApi_HostAddress}}/risk/{{PortfolioId}}
Accept: application/json
